WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:18.442
Kip picked up his beach towel.

2
00:00:18.443 --> 00:00:26.478
He went outside.

3
00:00:26.479 --> 00:00:29.273
"Good morning, Bird," said Kip.

4
00:00:29.274 --> 00:00:32.974
"I'm going to the beach.

5
00:00:32.975 --> 00:00:35.008
Do you want to come?"

6
00:00:35.009 --> 00:00:38.164
"I can't go now," said Bird.

7
00:00:38.165 --> 00:00:41.361
"I'm going to look for worms.

8
00:00:41.362 --> 00:00:44.182
I'll meet you at the beach later."

9
00:00:44.183 --> 00:00:46.140
"Okay," said Kip.

10
00:00:46.141 --> 00:00:50.774
"I'll see you later!"

11
00:00:50.775 --> 00:00:56.033
Kip went down the tree.

12
00:00:56.034 --> 00:00:59.555
He headed toward the beach.

13
00:00:59.556 --> 00:01:02.039
A woman ran by.

14
00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:04.749
Then a man ran by.

15
00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:10.875
A few more people ran by.

16
00:01:10.876 --> 00:01:16.501
Kip started to run too.

17
00:01:16.502 --> 00:01:19.996
"This is fun," he thought.

18
00:01:19.997 --> 00:01:23.317
"I like running!"

19
00:01:23.318 --> 00:01:25.865
Kip almost ran into a man.

20
00:01:25.866 --> 00:01:28.985
The man was carrying a small sign.

21
00:01:28.986 --> 00:01:38.455
He put the sign in the grass.

22
00:01:38.456 --> 00:01:40.464
Kip read the sign.

23
00:01:40.465 --> 00:01:45.590
"Big Race Tomorrow Morning.

24
00:01:45.591 --> 00:01:48.172
All Runners are Welcome."

25
00:01:48.173 --> 00:01:52.882
Kip gasped. "A big race!

26
00:01:52.883 --> 00:02:01.997
That sounds like fun!"
